{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addie Shen is a math based puzzle shooter.\u00a0Play solo, team up in co-op, or practice your skills to stop the evil\u00a0PEMDAS minions. Can you save the world with math?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.poster.avif?t=1767109283\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.webm?t=1767109283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.mp4?t=1767109283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between quadrants, dodge tricky tangents, and foil PEMDAS' calculated plans with the future of math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.poster.avif?t=1767109283\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.webm?t=1767109283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.mp4?t=1767109283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRACTICE MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your wits in fast paced, wave based exercises to help sharpen your math skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/1a42f3c8bffbcfe8831fb5d988890a31.poster.avif?t=1767109283\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/1a42f3c8bffbcfe8831fb5d988890a31.webm?t=1767109283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/1a42f3c8bffbcfe8831fb5d988890a31.mp4?t=1767109283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up for split screen challenges<strong>.</strong> Whether cooperating or competing, it\u2019s math-driven mayhem at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural math equations for infinite playthroughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode with 5 narrative missions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Mode with addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, and more</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer Mode with 4 competitive missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 player split-screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of math puns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calculus?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364130?t=1767109283","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3364130?t=1767109283","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/14da1d2deb64df773b6d11e6bc274af46026476b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767109283","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/14da1d2deb64df773b6d11e6bc